---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const breadcrumb = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://teatrojuarez.com/en/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Hours', item: 'https://teatrojuarez.com/en/horarios/' }
  ]
};
const faq = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'What are the Teatro Juárez opening hours?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'The Teatro Juárez does not keep a single fixed schedule because it operates as both a performing-arts venue and a historic monument. Access for visits, guided tours and performances changes with the season and the program. Confirm the day’s schedule through official channels before traveling.'
      }
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'When are visits and performances usually held?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'It is common for tourist visits to take place during the day and shows in the evening, but exact times depend on each performance or guided-visit type.'
      }
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'When is the theater most active?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'The venue runs programming throughout the year, with especially intense activity during the Festival Internacional Cervantino, held in Guanajuato in autumn.'
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  canonicalPath="/en/horarios/"
  title="Teatro Juárez Guanajuato hours: visits & performances"
  description="Visiting hours, guided tours and performance times for the Teatro Juárez in Guanajuato. Check the official channels before your visit."
>
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumb)} />
  <script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faq)} />

  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="section-label">Practical information</div><h1>Teatro Juárez hours</h1></div></section>
  <article class="prose">
    <p>The Teatro Juárez combines its role as a historic monument with a live performing-arts program. That is why <strong>there is no single fixed schedule</strong>: access to the hall, guided tours and performances change with the season, stage setups and the program.</p>

    <h2>Visits and performances</h2>
    <p>As an active venue, its doors open according to what is programmed. It is common for <strong>tourist visits</strong> to take place during the day and <strong>shows</strong> in the evening, but exact times depend on each performance or visit type.</p>
    <p>During the <strong>Festival Internacional Cervantino</strong>, held in Guanajuato in autumn, the venue’s activity intensifies and its program is especially dense.</p>

    <div class="notice">Before traveling, confirm the day’s schedule through official channels. This guide does not sell or reserve access.</div>

    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <div class="faq-item"><h3>What are the Teatro Juárez opening hours?</h3><p>The Teatro Juárez does not keep a single fixed schedule because it operates as both a performing-arts venue and a historic monument. Access for visits, guided tours and performances changes with the season and the program. Confirm the day’s schedule through official channels before traveling.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><h3>When are visits and performances usually held?</h3><p>It is common for tourist visits to take place during the day and shows in the evening, but exact times depend on each performance or guided-visit type.</p></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><h3>When is the theater most active?</h3><p>The venue runs programming throughout the year, with especially intense activity during the Festival Internacional Cervantino, held in Guanajuato in autumn.</p></div>
    </div>

    <nav class="related" aria-label="Related pages">
      <a href="/en/boletos/">Tickets →</a>
      <a href="/en/cartelera/">Event program →</a>
      <a href="/en/">Teatro Juárez guide →</a>
    </nav>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
